{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation","title":"实施路径","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"identity-centric-access","title":"身份中心访问控制","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/implementation/identity-centric-access","wordCount":1298,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"microsegmentation","title":"微隔离与东西向流量治理","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/implementation/microsegmentation","wordCount":1170,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"device-trust","title":"设备信任与端点合规","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/zero-trust-architecture/implementation/device-trust","wordCount":1357,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 实施路径\n\n原理落地为工程实践，需要在身份、设备、网络三个维度同步推进。本章覆盖以身份为核心的访问控制、基于微隔离的东西向流量治理、以及设备信任评估与端点合规。每篇文档都包含具体的技术选型、配置模式与生产环境注意事项。\n\n三篇文档覆盖零信任的三大支柱实施：身份优先、网络微隔离、设备信任。先把\"谁在请求\"搞清楚，再管\"请求能到哪\"，最后确认\"从什么设备发出\"。\n"}